stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Searching
    Searching --> Synced: heard ND_SYNC, adopt counter
    Searching --> Synced: join timeout, form new network (counter = 0)
    Synced --> Synced: hop every 500 ms
    Synced --> OutOfSync: long silence or drift detected
    OutOfSync --> Searching: broadcast ND_SYNC, then listen
